{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"a92b3b565a3a37dfc04a7c0003c932bab1afc0be5287ef066cafe55af5384b18","ja":"ねえねえ、星梨花ちゃん……。","zh":"我说我说，星梨花……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"973fb11c81ef89a202bfcc10932458b3e63ae5c84b92d026f50ceb72da521994","ja":"あっ、茜さん。どうかしましたか？","zh":"啊，茜。怎么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b769e484df9c5e65b587f03dbd6af1b2ee50f6571b3f70ebdb6e0f94b56f37c1","ja":"ごめん、今の電話聞こえちゃって……。\nでも、茜ちゃんはどうしても気になってしまったの！","zh":"抱歉，刚才听到你的电话了……\n但是，小茜实在是很在意！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d1c20b32c038cc449d86e4de4d934c99c27f5ced8e19c3ae1fdb087361700b8d","ja":"星梨花ちゃん、\n最近すごく頑張ってるけど、何かあったの！？","zh":"星梨花，\n最近特别拼呢，是发生什么事了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"9070f36efb77603cef9eb50b90b1a6c52f74fcbd21c01160edc8e481d68bd2d8","ja":"えっ？　特別なことは何もないですけど……？","zh":"欸？并没有什么特别的事呀……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"bd6f13994214653cb03564df6dae589ea19190d6c83f2b70048e6f467883d6b9","ja":"でもでも、なりふり構わず\nお仕事してるっていうか……。","zh":"但是但是，该说是不顾形象地\n在拼命工作吗……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5dda9c0eb1fe140486d3d7f532249ade957d12dc8b18933f9b5e2f5eef37546a","ja":"ハッ！　もしかして、\n茜ちゃんの公式ライバルに立候補しようと……！？","zh":"哈！难道说，\n是想自荐成为小茜的官方劲敌……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"135cdd02c1fd429dfa0565f084abf1eac91ced216dda58d3395c295d3ca49ca6","ja":"そうか……それなら茜ちゃんは納得だよっ♪\nうんうん。","zh":"这样啊……那小茜就完全能接受了♪\n嗯嗯。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"e0ddf8253a37d662114246d53f3bd1d1c945bec754dd6ac0e6a4cdc686e72749","ja":"そ、そんなことは考えてなかったですけど……。\nあっ、でもそう言われてみたら……。","zh":"没、没想过那种事就是了……。\n啊，不过被这么一说……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2e74e980bc98155f4ad688526ee1b602263739591fe62a650cd3ea947a278137","ja":"もしかしたらわたし、\n真珠星の影響を受けてたのかもしれないです。","zh":"说不定我也受到了\n真珠星的影响呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"616974b06cee1f62b581e0a17550d8cd73fb4313519ddaf96f3e02ffad880a78","ja":"へっ？　この前の公演の？","zh":"诶？上次公演的？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d0485f14506d11d99ec177a99b923318d15f7abdcec04d0a3b4b9ba1183e2767","ja":"どんなに大変でつらくても、必死に食らいついて\n頑張る強い真珠星を演じたから……。","zh":"无论多么艰难痛苦，都拼尽全力紧咬不放、\n努力奋战的坚强真珠星，正因为我演出了这样的角色……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"6d047fa7e3e8268c032cfe1c347caad97429f20bc7372984f568097ec0460624","ja":"あっ、なるほど～。たしかに最近の星梨花ちゃん、\n真珠星ちゃんっぽかったかも！","zh":"啊，原来如此～。最近的星梨花确实\n挺像真珠星的呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"a18da3a14a8835510d7265a421bd23acc1a66d0bf37b51d0cbbb4dd8aec18498","ja":"……もしかしてわたし、いつもと違うことで\nみなさんに心配をかけてしまったんでしょうか？","zh":"……难道是因为我和平时不太一样，\n让大家担心了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"b82d47fcc5f00c9e077732481ded1bc971758ca9df604daecd23c87cfc3d9a9b","ja":"ん～、心配っていうよりはビックリって感じかな？\nちなみに茜ちゃんは、謎が解けてスッキリだよ♪","zh":"嗯～与其说是担心，不如说是吃惊吧？\n顺便说一下，小茜解开了谜团，感觉神清气爽哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"81933ae41f3619bc4dba11f5783225c4be04ac9937cd9ae2a5007b801dfa5b62","ja":"それに、強気な感じの星梨花ちゃんも、\n新鮮でよかったと思うよ！","zh":"而且，强势感觉的星梨花\n也很新鲜很棒哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1417.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"31c6ec518df5c1ba20248a47c113cd58a3f7f5a4def49ec0c996625fe72a2c37","ja":"そうなんですか？\nそれじゃあもっともっと、頑張りますね♪","zh":"是这样吗？\n那我还要更加更加努力才行呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
